<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/orcidid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Open Researcher and Contributor ID (ORCID) iD](https://info.orcid.org/what-is-orcid/) is a unique identifier for authors and contributors in scholarly communication; as a subset of the International Standard Name Identifier (ISNI), it typically appears as a URI such as `https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1825-0097`."@en .
